+      "classification": "DEFINITION",
+      "rationale": "This guarded equation is the base case of the total finishPile mathematical summary: once I is at least N, it defines the named summary to be the accumulated ValSeq A. It matches no operational configuration and asserts no additional reusable mathematical fact."
+    },
+    {
+      "source_rule_id": "rule-63431e432f0bf08d6bc0c04732f82fcd4f0d71ba7458f65345b9c101ef3654d8",
+      "classification": "DEFINITION",
+      "rationale": "This guarded equation is the recursive case defining finishPile: while I is below N, it appends the next value N + 2*I and recurs at I + 1. It is a recurrence for the named proof summary, not an execution rule or a separately proved mathematical lemma."
+    }
+  ]
+}

